{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"7f67316fcd5b44e4","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    participant Silver as Silver Layer\n    participant ETL as Dynamic ETL\n    participant ELK as ELK\n    participant Match as Match Engine\n    participant Bus as Event Bus\n    participant WF as Workflow Engine\n    participant Store as Operational Store\n    participant UI as Steward UI\n\n    Silver ->> ETL: New / Changed records\n    ETL ->> ELK: Index records\n    ETL ->> Bus: Publish DATA_INDEXED event\n\n    Bus ->> Match: Consume DATA_INDEXED\n    Match ->> Match: Perform matching\n\n    Match ->> Store: Persist match results\n    Match ->> Bus: Publish MATCH_CLUSTER_READY\n\n    Bus ->> WF: Consume MATCH_CLUSTER_READY\n\n    alt Auto-Approve\n        WF ->> Store: Mark APPROVED\n        WF ->> Bus: Publish MATCH_APPROVED\n    else Needs Review\n        WF ->> WF: Start workflow instance\n        WF ->> WF: Auto-assign task\n        WF ->> UI: Task visible in bucket\n    end\n\n    UI ->> WF: Fetch tasks\n    UI ->> ELK: Fetch record details\n    UI ->> Store: Fetch match summary\n\n    UI ->> WF: Complete task (decision)\n\n    alt Approved\n        WF ->> Store: Update final state\n        WF ->> Bus: Publish MATCH_APPROVED\n    else Needs Further Review\n        WF ->> WF: Reassign task\n        WF ->> UI: Task moves bucket\n    else Rejected\n        WF ->> Store: Mark REJECTED\n        WF ->> Bus: Publish MATCH_REJECTED\n    end\n\n    Bus ->> ELK: Update summary index\n \n```\n","x":-260,"y":-211,"width":2060,"height":1731},
		{"id":"352f15c857e1875b","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    participant Silver as Silver Layer\n    participant ETL as Dynamic ETL\n    participant ELK as ELK\n    participant Match as Match Engine\n    participant WF as Workflow Engine\n    participant Store as Operational Store\n    participant UI as Steward UI\n\n    Silver ->> ETL: Scheduled batch extract\n    ETL ->> ELK: Bulk index records\n\n    Match ->> ELK: Read batch candidates\n    Match ->> Match: Perform batch matching\n    Match ->> Store: Persist match results\n\n    loop For each cluster needing review\n        Match ->> WF: Start workflow (clusterId)\n    end\n\n    WF ->> WF: Auto-assign tasks\n    WF ->> UI: Tasks visible in buckets\n\n    UI ->> WF: Fetch tasks\n    UI ->> ELK: Fetch record details\n    UI ->> Store: Fetch match summary\n\n    UI ->> WF: Complete task\n\n    alt Approved\n        WF ->> Store: Update final state\n        WF ->> ELK: Update index summary\n    else Needs Further Review\n        WF ->> WF: Reassign task\n        WF ->> UI: Task moves bucket\n    else Rejected\n        WF ->> Store: Mark rejected\n    end\n \n```","x":-260,"y":1680,"width":2060,"height":1320},
		{"id":"5e06ff7217105885","x":3626,"y":209,"width":2454,"height":511,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[Match Cluster\nNeeds Review]\n\n    A --> B[Start Workflow\n1 Cluster = 1 Case]\n\n    B --> C[Auto Assignment\nService Task]\n\n    C --> D[Steward Review\nUser Task]\n\n    D -->|Approve| E[End\nApproved]\n    D -->|Reject| F[End\nRejected]\n    D -->|Needs Further Review| G[Escalate\nService Task]\n\n    G --> H[Supervisor Review\nUser Task]\n\n    H -->|Approve| E\n    H -->|Reject| F\n    H -->|Needs Further Review| I[Escalate Again\nService Task]\n\n    I --> J[Admin Review\nUser Task]\n\n    J -->|Approve| E\n    J -->|Reject| F\n```"}
	],
